    <description>Products:
Cross Border Payments - FWXB1000

Migrated from the [Opp Product] B2B XB Utilization Calculation process using multiple criteria.
ARR Calculation for &quot;Cross Border - Commercial&quot; with Utilization and Estimated Annual Money Moved. Added ByPass to skip validation rules on Opportunity 05/14/2024. Update to make currency conversion and filter by product code; renewals should not generate ARR; use Ship_To_Account__r 07/24/2024. Use Quote_Line_Type__c instead of Opportunity.Type 07/26/2024. BOPI-511 Updated to calculate ARR when Quote Line Type not &apos;Cancellation&apos; or &apos;Renewal&apos;. BOPI-518 removing Opp criteria filters to let the flow run when renewals are created and the quote line fields are empty. BOPI-603 updated to set ARR to 0 for cancelled lines. BOPI-620 updated to set the ARR for cancelled lines to the original amount as a negative value
BOPI-857 Allow reps to set ARR to $0
SALDEV-1184 updated formulas for B2B XB ARR, UtilizationRevenueText, Added new Decision for &quot;New&quot; Quote Lines and Added an &quot;End&quot; if it didnt meet any criteria.
SALDEV-1277 – updated formula for constant 4% on FX version ≠ bank transfer
SALDEV-1312 - updated formula for constant 4% on FX version, added new formulas for Same Currency when Usage Type = Amount, and for Same Currency when Usage Type = Percent</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>B2B_XB_ARR</name>
        <dataType>Currency</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
  ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Transaction_Type__c}, &quot;FX&quot;),
  {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Est_Annual_MM__c} * 0.04 * {!UtilizationValue} / {!ConversionRate},
  +
  IF(
    AND(
      ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Transaction_Type__c}, &quot;Same Currency&quot;),
      ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Usage_Type__c}, &quot;Amount&quot;)
    ),
    {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Estimated_Volume__c} * {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Quoted_Usage_Amt__c} * {!UtilizationValue} / {!ConversionRate},
    +
    IF(
      AND(
        ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Transaction_Type__c}, &quot;Same Currency&quot;),
        ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Usage_Type__c}, &quot;Percent&quot;)
      ),
      {!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Est_Annual_MM__c}* ({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Quoted_Usage_Percent__c} / 100) * {!UtilizationValue} / {!ConversionRate},
      
      null /* Default value if no criteria are met */
    )))</expression>
        <scale>18</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Cancelled_ARR</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>{!Get_Original_Opportunity_Product_Cancellation.Opp_Product_ARR__c} * (-1)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_141_myRule_1_A1_5023655328</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.Family__c}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Renewals shouldn&apos;t generate ARR</description>
        <name>RenewalRevenueText</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Renewal Calculated: &quot; + TEXT( NOW() - 0.1666)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>UtilizationRevenueText</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
         ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Transaction_Type__c}, &quot;FX&quot;),
    /* Formula 1: Transaction Type = FX */
    (
&quot;B2B XB FX Est Annual MM $&quot; +
        TEXT({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Est_Annual_MM__c}) + &quot;*&quot; +
        &quot;0.04&quot; + &quot;*&quot; +
        TEXT({!UtilizationValue}) + &quot;/&quot; +
        TEXT({!ConversionRate})
    ),    
IF(
AND(            
ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Transaction_Type__c}, &quot;Same Currency&quot;),
      ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Usage_Type__c}, &quot;Amount&quot;)
    ),    
    /* Formula 2: Transaction Type = Same Currency and Usage Type = Amount */
    (
&quot;B2B XB Same Currency Est Volume  $&quot; + 
        TEXT({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Estimated_Volume__c}) + &quot;*&quot; + 
        TEXT({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Quoted_Usage_Amt__c}) + &quot;*&quot; + 
        TEXT({!UtilizationValue}) + &quot;/&quot; +
        TEXT({!ConversionRate})
    ),
 IF(
      AND(
        ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Transaction_Type__c}, &quot;Same Currency&quot;),
        ISPICKVAL({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Usage_Type__c}, &quot;Percent&quot;)
      ),
/* Formula 3: Transaction Type = Same Currency and Usage Type = Percent */
(
      TEXT({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Est_Annual_MM__c}) + &quot;*&quot; +  
TEXT(({!$Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Quoted_Usage_Percent__c} / 100)) +  &quot;*&quot; + 
Text({!UtilizationValue}) + &quot;/&quot; + Text({!ConversionRate})
),
&quot;&quot;
)))
+ &quot; &quot; +
&quot;Calculated&quot; + &quot; &quot; + TEXT(NOW()-0.0115)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description>Extract the actual value from the quote line utilization picklist</description>
        <name>UtilizationValue</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>CASE(
    $Record.SBQQ__QuoteLine__r.Utilization__c,
    &quot;20%&quot;, 0.2,
    &quot;40%&quot;, 0.4,
    &quot;60%&quot;, 0.6,
    &quot;80%&quot;, 0.8,
    &quot;100%&quot;, 1,
    0
)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
